<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/normal_post_locked_sticky.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Board Policies &nbsp;(Read 279 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1" title="View the profile of Kinladar">Kinladar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Ranger Bait<br />
								Moderator<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14300<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/macross.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Avatar can beat up your avatar!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/kinladar@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="kinladar@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=411.msg2555#msg2555"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=411.msg2555#msg2555">Board Policies</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> October 27, 2003, 01:21:38 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Really, it&#039;s pretty simple.<br /><br />These message boards were created with the intentions of giving the people who play on this server (Rodcet Nife) a place to come chat with one another, in an environment where free speech is respected.<br /><br />Most forums are moderated, but not to the degree that we feel will cause undo burden on people. Simply put, one swear word, or half a dozen in a thread may not cause a thread to be moved. Its how they are used that may cause some form of moderation.<br /><br />There is a Rants and Raves section that is completely unmoderated, and will stay as such. The only thing that may get someone banned would be if they continually flame using anon names. We have no problem with someone flaming others in that section, and said flames will not be edited or, removed but the poster may find them selves banned for not having the guts to use a real EQ name. (*Granted, we will not spend undo time trying to find name spoofers, however, obvious anon names that are created with the sole purpose to flame others may be scrutinized.) <br /><br />Basically, this thing was created so we can have some fun, joke around a bit, and remember the big picture, that this is really just a game, and we should be able to step back and laugh about it now and again.<br /><br />If anyone would have an issue that they feel needs addressed, please let myself, Killy, or Gnos know about it, and depending on what the problem is, will either discuss it as a group of mods, or take immediate action if it&amp;#8217;s deemed nesesary. I have complete trust in Killy and Gnos to be fair and objective.<br /><br />Killy is a member of Echoes in Eternity<br /><br />Gnos is a semi-retired bard who used to be a member of Arirang.<br /><br />Tilce is a Friend of Pepa&#039;s and needs to remind me what guild he&#039;s currently in.<br /><br />Pepa is a Member of Dol Amroth.<br /><br />I am a member of Fires of Time.<br /><br />We hope that this shows that despite some obvious past history, and potential past animosity, that these boards were created with the intention of reflecting all the server, and not just any single guild.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: December 09, 2003, 01:06:45 pm by Kinladar</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Guild Leader of <a href="http://www.fotguild.com" target="_blank">Fires of Time</a><br /><br /><span style="font-family: 2;">A little piece of paper with a picture drawn<br />&nbsp;floats on down the street till the wind is gone. <br />The memory now is like the picture was then, <br />When the paper&#039;s crumpled up, it can&#039;t be perfect again. </span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg2625"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1" title="View the profile of Kinladar">Kinladar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Ranger Bait<br />
								Moderator<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14300<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/macross.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Avatar can beat up your avatar!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/kinladar@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="kinladar@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=411.msg2625#msg2625"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=411.msg2625#msg2625">Re:Board Policies</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> October 28, 2003, 09:58:41 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Based off of a discussion that arose between mods, we are changing one small thing to board policies. It hasn&#039;t happened yet, but Gnos was thinking that we need to address this to cover our collective legal arses.<br /><br />Any attachments, links to, threads endorsing, etc... Illegal Activities will be removed from any forum they may be found in. Rants and Raves included in this case. It will be the only form of moderation that goes on in that section.<br /><br />If someone creates these types of posts more than once after removal of previous posts and have been warned, they will be banned.<br /><br />Examples of said links would be child pornography, illegal software downloads etc... IE, if the law says it&#039;s wrong to look at, read it, or in Grem&#039;s case, eat it, don&#039;t post a link to it.<br /><br />As stated above, it hasn&#039;t happend yet, (as of the time I am writing this post) and I hope it never needs to be invoked. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: December 09, 2003, 02:33:20 pm by Kinladar</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Guild Leader of <a href="http://www.fotguild.com" target="_blank">Fires of Time</a><br /><br /><span style="font-family: 2;">A little piece of paper with a picture drawn<br />&nbsp;floats on down the street till the wind is gone. <br />The memory now is like the picture was then, <br />When the paper&#039;s crumpled up, it can&#039;t be perfect again. </span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
